meta {
  name: User - Online status
  type: http
  seq: 103
}

patch {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/user/online-status
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "show_online_status": false
  }
}

docs {
  Show or hide when the current user is online (#1187, ADR 0027). false: the member never joins a presence channel, never appears in the online lists and sends no typing indicator; they still read the lists through the online-members endpoints. Returns the current user with show_online_status. Needs user:write.
}
